{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/gifs2.gif?t=1744049790\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Math has never been this action-packed! Step into <strong>Math Quest VR</strong>, where solving problems means blasting bandits with your paintball gun. Travel through exciting worlds of <strong>Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, and Division</strong>, unlocking new challenges along the way. Whether you're playing <strong>Story Mode</strong> to level up your skills or testing your speed in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>, every shot brings you closer to math mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solve math problems in a whole new way</strong> \u2013 aim, shoot, and answer to progress through thrilling levels.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744049790\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore interactive worlds</strong> themed around Addition, Subtraction, Multiplication, and Division.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/gifs4.gif?t=1744049790\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose your challenge</strong> \u2013 level up in <strong>Story Mode</strong> or race against time in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sharpen your reflexes and your mind</strong> with fast-paced, brain-boosting gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in immersive VR action</strong> that makes math fun, exciting, and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375640/extras/gifs3.gif?t=1744049790\" /